<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="40915150"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="913726957"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Rude (Zedd Remix)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Zedd"/><amll:meta key="album" value="True Colors (Perfect Edition)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:33.231"><div begin="00:02.726" end="04:27.504"><p begin="00:02.726" end="00:06.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Saturday morning, jumped out of bed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">周六早上早起出门 换上最豪华的西服</span></p><p begin="00:07.241" end="00:09.394" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">And put on my best suit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">换上最豪华的西服</span></p><p begin="00:10.195" end="00:14.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Got in my car and raced like a jet<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开启车门高速狂飙</span></p><p begin="00:14.862" end="00:16.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">All the way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直奔你家大门而去</span></p><p begin="00:17.562" end="00:21.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Knocked on your door with heart in my hand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直奔你家大门而去 拳拳热枕 轻嗑大门</span></p><p begin="00:21.985" end="00:24.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">To ask you a question<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">诚惶诚恐 真挚问询</span></p><p begin="00:24.731" end="00:26.592" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">'Cause I know that you're<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心知肚明 你很保守</span></p><p begin="00:26.602" end="00:31.422" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">An old fashioned man, yeah, yeah</p><p begin="00:31.432" end="00:34.544" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Can I have your daughter for the rest of my life?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下半辈子能否让我替你照顾你的女儿 请你务必要答应</span></p><p begin="00:34.554" end="00:37.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Say yes, say yes 'cause I need to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你务必要答应</span></p><p begin="00:38.156" end="00:42.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">You say I'll never get your blessing till the day I die<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你却说道 除非我下地狱 否则绝不会祝福我们</span></p><p begin="00:42.084" end="00:46.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Tough luck, my friend, but the answer is no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命运多舛 为何如此折磨我</span></p><p begin="00:46.970" end="00:50.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="00:50.820" end="00:53.664" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Don't you know I'm human, too?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你不知道我的心也是肉长的</span></p><p begin="00:54.320" end="00:57.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="00:58.470" end="01:00.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I'm gonna marry her anyway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管如何我和她结婚是结定了</span></p><p begin="01:00.989" end="01:04.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">(Marry that girl) Marry her anyway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和她白头偕老</span></p><p begin="01:04.681" end="01:08.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">(Marry that girl) Yeah, no matter what you say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和她白头偕老</span></p><p begin="01:08.368" end="01:11.848" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">(Marry that girl) And we'll be a family<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和她白头偕老</span></p><p begin="01:12.977" end="01:18.447" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="01:27.489" end="01:30.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="01:42.331" end="01:45.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="02:00.783" end="02:03.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="02:04.624" end="02:07.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Don't you know I'm human, too?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你不知道我的心也是肉长的</span></p><p begin="02:08.174" end="02:11.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="02:12.295" end="02:14.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">I'm gonna marry her anyway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管如何我和她结婚是结定了 非我本意</span></p><p begin="02:15.772" end="02:19.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">I hate to do this, you leave no choice<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我已无选择</span></p><p begin="02:19.873" end="02:22.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Can't live without her<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有她我就活不下去</span></p><p begin="02:23.139" end="02:26.691" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Love me or hate me, we will be both<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管你怎么看我</span></p><p begin="02:27.204" end="02:29.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Standing at that alter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">结婚当天我们定会出现在一起</span></p><p begin="02:30.740" end="02:32.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Or we will run away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">否则别怪我和你女儿私奔</span></p><p begin="02:34.209" end="02:37.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">To another galaxy, you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跑到天涯海角 你休想找到</span></p><p begin="02:37.697" end="02:40.298" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">You know she's in love with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你明知道她很爱我</span></p><p begin="02:41.465" end="02:44.366" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">She will go anywhere I go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必定会一辈子跟随我</span></p><p begin="02:44.376" end="02:47.446" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Can I have your daughter for the rest of my life?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下半辈子能否让我替你照顾你的女儿</span></p><p begin="02:47.456" end="02:50.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Say yes, say yes 'cause I need to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请你务必要答应</span></p><p begin="02:51.066" end="02:54.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">You say I'll never get your blessing till the day I die<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你却说道 除非我下地狱 否则绝不会祝福我们</span></p><p begin="02:54.960" end="02:59.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Tough luck, my friend, 'cause the answer's still no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命运多舛 为何如此折磨我</span></p><p begin="02:59.853" end="03:02.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="03:03.771" end="03:06.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Don't you know I'm human, too?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你不知道我的心也是肉长的</span></p><p begin="03:07.220" end="03:10.232" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="03:11.382" end="03:13.472" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">I'm gonna marry her anyway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管如何我和她结婚是结定了</span></p><p begin="03:13.913" end="03:17.181" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">(Marry that girl) Marry her anyway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和她白头偕老</span></p><p begin="03:17.622" end="03:21.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">(Marry that girl) No matter what you say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和她白头偕老</span></p><p begin="03:21.314" end="03:24.605" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">(Marry that girl) And we'll be a family<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和她白头偕老</span></p><p begin="03:25.754" end="03:31.216" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="03:40.485" end="03:43.435" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="03:55.252" end="03:58.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="04:13.694" end="04:16.736" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="04:17.595" end="04:20.393" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Don't you know I'm human, too?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你不知道我的心也是肉长的</span></p><p begin="04:21.072" end="04:24.102" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Why you gotta be so rude?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你要如此不解风情</span></p><p begin="04:25.246" end="04:27.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">I'm gonna marry her anyway<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管如何我和她结婚是结定了</span></p></div></body></tt>